    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45542" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔψῡχ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of good courage, stout of heart</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θράσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					394
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνήρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					510
				</span></i>
			, etc.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				6.20
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ . . ἐς τὰ ἔργα εὔψυχον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.39
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.126
			</span></i>; -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ότατοι πρὸς τὸ ἐπιέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.11
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				8.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύχω</span>) <i>cooling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.14.1
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			).</div>
